msgid ""
"It is recommended to use this effect while in Color layout as this comes "
"with :ref:`RGB Parade <view-rgb_parade>` and :ref:`view-histogram` already "
"switched on. If you want to use the effect while in Editing or Effects "
"layout, turn on the Histogram :term:`widget` with :menuselection:`Menu --> "
"View --> Histogram`."
msgstr ""
"Odporúča sa používať tento efekt v rozložení Color, ktoré je dodávané s :ref:"
"`RGB Parade <view-rgb_parade>` a :ref:`view-histogram` už zapnutými. Ak "
"chcete efekt používať v rozložení Editing alebo Effects, zapnite widget "
"Histogram pomocou :menuselection:`Menu --> Zobraziť --> Histogram`."

